error[E4205]: returned closure captures `k` by reference, but `k` is dropped when the function returns
  --> tests/borrows/fail/E4205_closure_escapes.tarn:29:5
   |
29 |     return fn(x) i64 { return x + k }
   |     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ the closure escapes here
   |            -------------------------- `k` is captured by reference here
   |
   = note: closures capture by reference in v0; capture by value is not supported yet
   = help: pass the value to the closure as a parameter instead of capturing it

